  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou, son of man, take thee a sharp knife, take thee a barber's razor, and cause",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to pass upon thine head and upon thy beard: then take thee balances to weigh, and divide the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "hair",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt burn with fire a third part in the midst of the city, when the days of the siege are fulfilled: and thou shalt take a third part,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "smite about it with a knife: and a third part thou shalt scatter in the wind; and I will draw out a sword after them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt also take thereof a few in number, and bind them in thy skirts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then take of them again, and cast them into the midst of the fire, and burn them in the fire;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thereof shall a fire come forth into all the house of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; This",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem: I have set it in the midst of the nations and countries",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And she hath changed my judgments into wickedness more than the nations, and my statutes more than the countries that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about her: for they have refused my judgments and my statutes, they have not walked in them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Because ye multiplied more than the nations that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "have not walked in my statutes, neither have kept my judgments, neither have done according to the judgments of the nations that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about you;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Behold, I, even I,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against thee, and will execute judgments in the midst of thee in the sight of the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will do in thee that which I have not done, and whereunto I will not do any more the like, because of all thine abominations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore the fathers shall eat the sons in the midst of thee, and the sons shall eat their fathers; and I will execute judgments in thee, and the whole remnant of thee will I scatter into all the winds.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I live, saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Surely, because thou hast defiled my sanctuary with all thy detestable things, and with all thine abominations, therefore will I also diminish",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thee;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neither shall mine eye spare, neither will I have any pity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ A third part of thee shall die with the pestilence, and with famine shall they be consumed in the midst of thee: and a third part shall fall by the sword round about thee; and I will scatter a third part into all the winds, and I will draw out a sword after them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus shall mine anger be accomplished, and I will cause my fury to rest upon them, and I will be comforted: and they shall know that I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "have spoken",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in my zeal, when I have accomplished my fury in them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover I will make thee waste, and a reproach among the nations that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about thee, in the sight of all that pass by.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So it shall be a reproach and a taunt, an instruction and an astonishment unto the nations that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.5.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
